<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f6f6;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f6f6f6;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;margin:24px 0;padding:32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>Hi,</p>
                <p>Someone requested an email-address change on your {{ app_name }} account. A verification link was sent to the new address — your account still uses this address until that link is opened.</p>
                <p>If this was not you, sign in and change your password right away. Your password still works, and nothing about your account has changed yet.</p>
                <p>— The {{ app_name }} team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
